{"id":"vod_sn_35578","vodId":"35578","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔法少女奈叶As","name_cn":"魔法少女奈叶As","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/179ce0fdd053e173d3cd2f4e67faeaa9.jpg"},"summary":"奈叶（田村由香里 配音）本是一位平凡的小学三年级女生，却因为意外遇见了来自异世界的尤诺而成为了魔法少女，投入到了争夺遗产的战斗之中。在上一次事件结束之后，奈叶告别了与之结下深厚友谊的菲特（水树奈奈 配音），重新回归了平静的日常生活，接受着魔力训练，以防备敌人的下一轮猛烈袭击。　　某日，一个神秘的魔法结界出现在了海鸣市的上空，这不寻常的现象吸引了奈叶的注意。果不其然，奈叶遭到了红发魔法少女维塔（真田麻美 配音）的攻击，让奈叶没有想到的是，维塔竟然一下子就破坏了奈叶坚固的防御。所幸菲特及时出现，奈叶才幸免于难，而维塔的出现意味着，有一场阴谋正在秘密展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/stNEDfgT3H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UEihJavqkM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/96iEVsGdDy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PyTkRTzjVB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jGq4ZKnntK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3P4eNz31fx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gAyb461THL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZrVGCQk2bm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C0f7Pgg7281/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/THGAZZmxsJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r84pAfuTE01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6fyU7Ly2nA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Wg1QcHcEhN1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:33.273Z"}